{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港股跌逾500點，指數跌至23,100點水平。</p><p></p><p>恒指低開138點後，跌幅擴大至逾500點。</p><p></p><p>科網股拖低大市，阿里巴巴及網易跌半成。寧德時代延續上日跌勢，再跌百分之4。</p><p></p><p>傳聯想尋求20億美元銀團貸款，股價跌百分之6。布魯可被控股股東減持，套現超過2.5億元，股價跌一成六。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:42:10.166527+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:18:02.267409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:37:52.169809+00:00","content_hash":"e413e4a378187cb1220398b0c1d35f26e92ce9cd171c536e276d88403dce308c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}